{"id":"fb5e07d472a8bf03","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-consistency.md","title":"真理理论的一致性层级","display":"df-truth-consistency — 真理理论的一致性层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-consistency","aliases":["91-df-truth-consistency","91-df-consistency-in-truth-theory","91-df-theory-consistency"],"display":"df-truth-consistency — 真理理论的一致性层级","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-consistency]]","[[91-df-external-consistency]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-consistency</span><span>91-df-consistency-in-truth-theory</span><span>91-df-theory-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-consistency — 真理理论的一致性层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"656104419469b4d0\" href=\"?note=656104419469b4d0\" title=\"91-df-internal-consistency\">91-df-internal-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5085dd84d7b744a\" href=\"?note=c5085dd84d7b744a\" title=\"91-df-external-consistency\">91-df-external-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-consistency-—-真理理论的一致性层级-$\\mathrm{TruthCon}$\">df-truth-consistency — 真理理论的一致性层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthCon}\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthCon}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (待考察的可递归公理化真理理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (承担内部证明的理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (相对一致性的基础理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> (形式化相对一致性的背景理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数结构)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> (标准算术化一致性句)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{ext}}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{ext}}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{int}}(U,\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{int}}(U,\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> 是下述分别定义的一元外部一致性与二元可证一致性性质缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{rel}}_B(\\mathcal T_T/S)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{rel}}_B(\\mathcal T_T/S)\\)</span> 是下述定义的相对一致性性质缩写；斜线排列两个理论参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T,S\">\\(\\mathcal T_T,S\\)</span>，背景理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 固定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ext},\\mathrm{int},\\mathrm{rel}\">\\(\\mathrm{ext},\\mathrm{int},\\mathrm{rel}\\)</span> 标明三种元层接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{ext}}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{ext}}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{int}}(U,\\mathcal T_T)\n\\coloneqq\nU\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{int}}(U,\\mathcal T_T)\n\\coloneqq\nU\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{rel}}_B(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\coloneqq\nB\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{rel}}_B(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\coloneqq\nB\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三种上标分别表示：元理论中确实无矛盾、某个明确理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 证明一致性句、\n以及背景理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 证明相对一致性蕴涵。对象式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n只说一个真理谓词\n接受该句，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> 的定义。</p>\n<p>TB、UTB 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 的标准保守性支持它们相对于 PA 的\n一致性校准；这不等于 PA 无条件证明这些扩张的一致性。标准全归纳 KF\n能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，但在第二不完备定理的通常条件下\n不能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>FS 可与有限迭代的分层真理理论作相对一致性比较，同时又按 McGee 定理\n是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的。它的语法一致性不需要假设 FS 自身\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致；把二者写成等价或把后者当作一致性前提都会颠倒结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-consistency-—-真理理论的一致性层级-$\\mathrm{TruthCon}$","text":"df-truth-consistency — 真理理论的一致性层级 $\\mathrm{TruthCon}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"656104419469b4d0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"c5085dd84d7b744a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthCon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{ext}}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{int}}(U,\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthCon}^{\\mathrm{rel}}_B(\\mathcal T_T/S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T,S","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ext},\\mathrm{int},\\mathrm{rel}","d